==Government==
Septimont is lead by the Ephor, head of the city. The Priestess can foretell fate and can that makes the final calls and acts alongside the Ephor. Most people trust her judgement. They are accompanied by a [[Council of Elders]] who advises the Ephor but ultimately, the decision-making comes down to them. The Ephor's word is law as the rule of Septimont is those who have Power stands at the top. The current Ephor is [[Augusta]] and the current Priestess is [[Iuno]], who is considered extreme in the line of Priestesses. Not everyone agrees with her behavior despite her capabilities.

